Okay, sa labas ng bintana.

690
00:45:16.004 --> 00:45:18.841
Hoy, at least takpan mo yang mukha mo.

691
00:45:18.924 --> 00:45:20.801
Bilisan mo, takpan mo ang mukha ng iyong anak.

692
00:45:23.804 --> 00:45:24.847
Magandang ideya.

693
00:45:24.930 --> 00:45:26.974
Tingnan mo itong mga babaeng pinakain.

694
00:45:27.057 --> 00:45:29.518
Wala silang magawa,
