748
00:48:34.578 --> 00:48:35.537
Oh, talaga?

749
00:48:36.246 --> 00:48:39.917
Uh, nag-aalala itong nayon
Masyadong marami tungkol sa aking mga hairpins.

750
00:48:42.127 --> 00:48:44.087
Pero nagbago ka, Ae-sun.

751
00:48:44.671 --> 00:48:45.881
Nakikita nilang lahat.

752
00:48:46.715 --> 00:48:48.759
Mas maganda ang pananamit mo kaysa dati.

753
